-- Issue #17: `admin/FailureReported(…)` emits `failures`' trigger from
-- `migrations`, through the alias it imported it under. It was read as neither
-- a creation nor a trigger, so `Record` never ran and `creating n:
-- failures/Notice` caught nothing.

journey EmitIntoAnotherModule {
    cast:
        m: migrations/Migration
    given:
        m.failed = false
    1. fail
        m does Fail(m) on MigrationPage
            creating n: failures/Notice
        then m.failed = true
        then Record fires
        then n.kind = "migration"
        then n.text = "boom"
}
